# Recommendation System

## Overview

This project is a simple Recommendation System developed as part of the CodSoft Artificial Intelligence Internship. The system recommends items to users based on their preferences using recommendation techniques.

The goal of this project is to understand how recommendation engines work and how they can be used to provide personalized suggestions.

## Features

* Personalized recommendations
* User-friendly interface
* Fast recommendation generation
* Suggests similar items based on user preferences
* Easy to expand with larger datasets

## Technologies Used

* Python / HTML, CSS, JavaScript
* Recommendation Algorithms
* Content-Based Filtering
* Collaborative Filtering (optional)

## How It Works

1. The user selects an item of interest.
2. The system analyzes the selected item.
3. Similar items are identified using recommendation techniques.
4. Recommended items are displayed to the user.

## Example Use Cases

* Movie Recommendations
* Book Recommendations
* Product Recommendations
* Music Recommendations

